msgstr "此输出展示了 man:gvinum[8] 的简略列表格式。它在 crossref:vinum[vinum-simple-vol, A Simple [.filename]#vinum# Volume] 中以图形形式呈现。"

#. type: Block title
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:274
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "A Simple [.filename]#vinum# Volume"
