msgstr "设置好 [.filename]#vinum# 根卷后，运行 `gvinum l -rv root` 可能会得到如下输出："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:654
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"...\n"
"Subdisk root.p0.s0:\n"
"\t\tSize:        125829120 bytes (120 MB)\n"
"\t\tState: up\n"
"\t\tPlex root.p0 at offset 0 (0  B)\n"
"\t\tDrive disk0 (/dev/da0h) at offset 135680 (132 kB)\n"
msgstr "...\nSubdisk root.p0.s0:\n\t\tSize:        125829120 bytes (120 MB)\n\t\tState: up\n\t\tPlex root.p0 at offset 0 (0  B)\n\t\tDrive disk0 (/dev/da0h) at offset 135680 (132 kB)\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:660
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Subdisk root.p1.s0:\n"
"\t\tSize:        125829120 bytes (120 MB)\n"
"\t\tState: up\n"
"\t\tPlex root.p1 at offset 0 (0  B)\n"
"\t\tDrive disk1 (/dev/da1h) at offset 135680 (132 kB)\n"
msgstr "Subdisk root.p1.s0:\n\t\tSize:        125829120 bytes (120 MB)\n\t\tState: up\n\t\tPlex root.p1 at offset 0 (0  B)\n\t\tDrive disk1 (/dev/da1h) at offset 135680 (132 kB)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:666
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The values to note are `135680` for the offset, relative to partition [."
"filename]#/dev/da0h#.  This translates to 265 512-byte disk blocks in "
"`bsdlabel`'s terms.  Likewise, the size of this root volume is 245760 512-"
