"...\n"
"8 partitions:\n"
"#        size   offset    fstype   [fsize bsize bps/cpg]\n"
"  a:   245760      281    4.2BSD     2048 16384     0  # (Cyl.    0*- 15*)\n"
"  c: 71771688        0    unused        0     0        # (Cyl.    0 - 4467*)\n"
"  h: 71771672       16     vinum                       # (Cyl.    0*- 4467*)\n"
msgstr "...\n8 partitions:\n#        size   offset    fstype   [fsize bsize bps/cpg]\n  a:   245760      281    4.2BSD     2048 16384     0  # (Cyl.    0*- 15*)\n  c: 71771688        0    unused        0     0        # (Cyl.    0 - 4467*)\n  h: 71771672       16     vinum                       # (Cyl.    0*- 4467*)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:683
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It can be observed that the `size` parameter for the faked `a` partition "
"matches the value outlined above, while the `offset` parameter is the sum of "
"the offset within the [.filename]#vinum# partition `h`, and the offset of "
"this partition within the device or slice.  This is a typical setup that is "
"necessary to avoid the problem described in crossref:vinum[vinum-root-panic,"
"\"Nothing Boots, the Bootstrap Panics\"].  The entire `a` partition is "
"completely within the `h` partition containing all the [.filename]#vinum# "
"data for this device."
msgstr "可以看到，虚拟 `a` 分区的 `size` 参数与上文所述的值相符，而 `offset` 参数则是 [.filename]#vinum# 分区 `h` 内的偏移量与此分区在设备或切片内的偏移量之和。这是一种典型设置，可避免 crossref:vinum[vinum-root-panic,\"引导失败，引导程序发生紧急故障\"] 中描述的问题。整个 `a` 分区完全位于 `h` 分区内，而该分区包含此设备上的所有 [.filename]#vinum# 数据。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:685
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the above example, the entire device is dedicated to [.filename]#vinum# "
"and there is no leftover pre-[.filename]#vinum# root partition."
msgstr "在上述示例中，整个设备都专用于 [.filename]#vinum#，没有遗留 [.filename]#vinum# 之前的根分区。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:686
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:689
#, fuzzy
msgid "The following list contains a few known pitfalls and solutions."
msgstr "以下列表列出了一些已知问题及其解决方法。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:690
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "System Bootstrap Loads, but System Does Not Boot"
msgstr "系统引导程序已加载，但系统无法启动"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:694
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If for any reason the system does not continue to boot, the bootstrap can be "
"interrupted by pressing kbd:[space] at the 10-seconds warning.  The loader "
"variable `vinum.autostart` can be examined by typing `show` and manipulated "
"using `set` or `unset`."
msgstr "如果系统因任何原因无法继续启动，可以在 10 秒警告期间按 kbd:[space] 中断引导程序。输入 `show` 可以查看引导程序变量 `vinum.autostart`，并可使用 `set` 或 `unset` 修改它。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:696
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the [.filename]#vinum# kernel module was not yet in the list of modules "
"to load automatically, type `load geom_vinum`."
msgstr "如果 [.filename]#vinum# 内核模块尚未列入自动加载的模块列表，请输入 `load geom_vinum`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:699
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When ready, the boot process can be continued by typing `boot -as` which `-"
"as` requests the kernel to ask for the root file system to mount (`-a`) and "
"make the boot process stop in single-user mode (`-s`), where the root file "
"system is mounted read-only.  That way, even if only one plex of a multi-"
"plex volume has been mounted, no data inconsistency between plexes is being "
"risked."
msgstr "准备就绪后，可以输入 `boot -as` 继续启动过程，其中 `-as` 会要求内核询问要挂载的根文件系统（`-a`），并让启动过程停在单用户模式（`-s`），此时根文件系统以只读方式挂载。这样，即使多 plex 卷中只有一个 plex 被挂载，也不会冒着 plex 之间数据不一致的风险。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:705
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"At the prompt asking for a root file system to mount, any device that "
"contains a valid root file system can be entered.  If [.filename]#/etc/"
"fstab# is set up correctly, the default should be something like `ufs:/dev/"
"gvinum/root`.  A typical alternate choice would be something like `ufs:da0d` "
"which could be a hypothetical partition containing the pre-[."
"filename]#vinum# root file system.  Care should be taken if one of the alias "
"`a` partitions is entered here, that it actually references the subdisks of "
"the [.filename]#vinum# root device, because in a mirrored setup, this would "
"only mount one piece of a mirrored root device.  If this file system is to "
"be mounted read-write later on, it is necessary to remove the other plex(es) "
"of the [.filename]#vinum# root volume since these plexes would otherwise "
"carry inconsistent data."
msgstr "在询问要挂载哪个根文件系统的提示符处，可以输入任何包含有效根文件系统的设备。如果 [.filename]#/etc/fstab# 设置正确，默认值应类似于 `ufs:/dev/gvinum/root`。一个典型的备用选项可能是 `ufs:da0d`，它可以是假设存在的、包含 [.filename]#vinum# 之前根文件系统的分区。如果在此处输入某个别名 `a` 分区，请务必确认它实际指向 [.filename]#vinum# 根设备的子磁盘，因为在镜像设置中，这样只会挂载镜像根设备的一部分。如果之后要以读写方式挂载此文件系统，则必须移除 [.filename]#vinum# 根卷的其他 plex，否则这些 plex 中的数据会不一致。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:706
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Only Primary Bootstrap Loads"
msgstr "仅主引导程序已加载"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:711
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If [.filename]#/boot/loader# fails to load, but the primary bootstrap still "
"loads (visible by a single dash in the left column of the screen right after "
"the boot process starts), an attempt can be made to interrupt the primary "
"bootstrap by pressing kbd:[space].  This will make the bootstrap stop in "
"extref:{handbook}boot[stage two, boot-boot1].  An attempt can be made here "
"to boot off an alternate partition, like the partition containing the "
"previous root file system that has been moved away from `a`."
msgstr "如果 [.filename]#/boot/loader# 无法加载，但主引导程序仍能加载（启动过程开始后，屏幕左栏会显示一个短横线），可以尝试按 kbd:[space] 中断主引导程序。这样会让引导程序停在 extref:{handbook}boot[第二阶段，boot-boot1]。此时可以尝试从备用分区启动，例如已从 `a` 分区移走的旧根文件系统所在分区。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:713
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Nothing Boots, the Bootstrap Panics"
msgstr "无法启动，引导程序发生紧急故障"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:719
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This situation will happen if the bootstrap had been destroyed by the [."
"filename]#vinum# installation.  Unfortunately, [.filename]#vinum# "
"accidentally leaves only 4 KB at the beginning of its partition free before "
"starting to write its [.filename]#vinum# header information.  However, the "
"stage one and two bootstraps plus the bsdlabel require 8 KB.  So if a [."
"filename]#vinum# partition was started at offset 0 within a slice or disk "
"that was meant to be bootable, the [.filename]#vinum# setup will trash the "
"bootstrap."
msgstr "如果 [.filename]#vinum# 安装破坏了引导程序，就会出现这种情况。不幸的是， [.filename]#vinum# 在开始写入其头部信息之前，会意外地只在分区开头留下 4 KB 空间。然而，第一和第二阶段引导程序以及 bsdlabel 总共需要 8 KB。因此，如果 [.filename]#vinum# 分区从可启动切片或磁盘内的偏移量 0 开始， [.filename]#vinum# 设置就会破坏引导程序。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/vinum/_index.adoc:722
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Similarly, if the above situation has been recovered, by booting from a "
"\"Fixit\" media, and the bootstrap has been re-installed using `bsdlabel -B` "
"as described in extref:{handbook}boot[stage two, boot-boot1], the bootstrap "
"will trash the [.filename]#vinum# header, and [.filename]#vinum# will no "
"longer find its disk(s).  Though no actual [.filename]#vinum# configuration "
"data or data in [.filename]#vinum# volumes will be trashed, and it would be "
"possible to recover all the data by entering exactly the same [."
"filename]#vinum# configuration data again, the situation is hard to fix.  It "
"is necessary to move the entire [.filename]#vinum# partition by at least 4 "
"KB, to have the [.filename]#vinum# header and the system bootstrap no longer "
"collide."
msgstr "类似地，如果通过从“Fixit”介质启动恢复了上述情况，并按照 extref:{handbook}boot[第二阶段，boot-boot1] 中的说明使用 `bsdlabel -B` 重新安装了引导程序，那么引导程序就会破坏 [.filename]#vinum# 头部，导致 [.filename]#vinum# 再也找不到其磁盘。虽然实际的 [.filename]#vinum# 配置数据或 [.filename]#vinum# 卷中的数据不会被破坏，并且可以通过重新输入完全相同的 [.filename]#vinum# 配置数据来恢复所有数据，但这种情况很难修复。必须将整个 [.filename]#vinum# 分区至少移动 4 KB，避免 [.filename]#vinum# 头部与系统引导程序发生冲突。"
